msgid "Quitting now will cancel the operation and leave the target incomplete."
msgstr "现在退出将取消操作，并使目标不完整。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1005 src/ptc-gtk4.c:1553
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1005
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "退出"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1075
msgid "Select source device or image"
msgstr "选择源设备或镜像"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1110
msgid "Select target device or image"
msgstr "选择目标设备或镜像"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1145
msgid "Select log file"
msgstr "选择日志文件"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1224
#, c-format
msgid "self-test: cloning %s"
msgstr "自检：正在克隆 %s"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1293
msgid "Whole-disk image options (format 0003)"
msgstr "整盘镜像选项（格式 0003）"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1309
msgid ""
"How the gaps between partitions (boot loaders, padding, backup GPT) are "
"stored."
msgstr "分区之间的间隙（引导加载程序、填充、备份 GPT）如何存储。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1311
msgid "Gaps"
msgstr "间隙"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1317
msgid ""
"How the partition table is written on restore: verbatim, or rebuilt for a "
"target of a different size."
msgstr "还原时如何写入分区表：原样写入，或为不同大小的目标重建。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1323
msgid "Store raw volumes sparsely"
msgstr "以稀疏方式存储原始卷"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1325
msgid ""
"Use a zero-detecting bitmap for raw volumes (gaps and unsupported "
"partitions)."
msgstr "对原始卷（间隙和不支持的分区）使用零检测位图。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1328
msgid "Store every partition as raw"
msgstr "将每个分区存储为原始卷"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1330
msgid ""
"Do not use the per-filesystem backend, so every partition is a raw volume."
msgstr "不使用按文件系统的后端，因此每个分区都是原始卷。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1333
msgid "Do not zero skipped blocks"
msgstr "不将跳过的块清零"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1335
msgid ""
"On restore, leave blocks absent from the image untouched instead of writing "
"zeros."
msgstr "还原时，对镜像中缺失的块保持不变，而不是写入零。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1338
msgid "Grow the last partition"
msgstr "扩展最后一个分区"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1340
msgid ""
"On a larger target, extend the last partition entry (the filesystem itself "
"is not resized)."
msgstr "在更大的目标上扩展最后一个分区条目（文件系统本身不会调整大小）。"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1363
msgid "_Run"
msgstr "_运行"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1364
msgid "_Inspect image..."
msgstr "查看镜像(_I)…"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1365
msgid "_Clear log"
msgstr "_清除日志"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1366
msgid "_About"
msgstr "_关于"

#: src/ptc-gtk4.c:1367
msgid "_Quit"
msgstr "_退出"

